r":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-11T20:00:51-08:00","id":806699,"title":"","content":"Bone: A <b>Provider</b> looks to the needs of others before their own. Their altruism has a habit of including not just their packmates but to others as well. When they see need they respond with action. Recover a point of willpower when you selflessly provide for others, Regain all willpower when you render aid that makes you weaker or uses up resources for the hunt to come.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/865-welshboi","name":"WelshBoi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T17:13:22-08:00","id":1057841,"title":"","content":"I ended up with something new for a 2e Irraka I'm playing.<br /> <br /> Blood: <b>The Gremlin</b><br /> Like the wolf that targets the oldest or sickest members of a herd or a hacker who targets flaws in security, this character\u2019s always searching for the fatal flaw she can use.<ul><li>Regain 1 WP whenever you discern and exploit a weakness.</li> <li>Regain all spent WP when you deliberately enter Kuruth to tear at whatever weakness you\u2019ve found.</li> </ul><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently playing at Fabula Rasa in the Cold Equations venue; planning an Obrimos for Fallen London.<br /> I can also be found at <a href=\"http://darkersolstice.tumblr.com\" target=\"_blank\">http://darkersolstice.tumblr.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2192-heu","name":"Heu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-02T09:43:15-07:00","id":1123908,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar269_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"269\" data-vbnamecard=\"269\">Charlaquin</a>, I wonder why this topic is still not sticked on Werewolf forum - I just spent 20 minutes to uncover him from depths of search for creating new Uratha character...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-02T10:58:43-07:00","id":1123936,"title":"","content":"Should probably have a Stickied Homebrew Mechanics, and a Stickied Homebrew Setting threads, with links to individual threads in each. This would be more appropriate for Homebrew Mechanics.<br /> <br /> Or the Homebrew thread could have two sections to it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 08-02-2017, 02:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110